  "contract": [
    "Data type1 converts signed32 samples to float32, stores first output, reloads unsigned16 drive and divides by1000 then drive. Zero drive writes positive zero. Other nonzero types leave both outputs unchanged.",
    "Type0 preserves register-shift semantics for byte counts through255 and signed low16 group multiplication with32-bit channel/address wrap. First-output store precedes live drive/chip/gain reloads. Drive is unsigned16, contrary to the decompiler short declaration.",
    "Nominal calibration is one writable30-word object at the native20007d10..20007d88 range:13 chip1,9 chip2 and8 chip0 words. Cross-table indices inside these30 words remain live. Reserved indices beyond it retain direct reads of surrounding native SRAM; no neighboring state is duplicated or initialized by this owner.",
    "Chip0 preserves float32 *2 *800 *1000, then native encoded double /131072 *1000 /gain /drive. Chips1/2 preserve encoded double *1.8 /131072 /gain /drive *1e9. Reuse actual C native i2d,f2d,double multiply/divide,d2f and shift helpers; do not replace native encoded semantics with a generic cast/library.",
    "Full stock pow replay for10^3,10^9,2^17 proves exact constants1000,1e9,131072 under all rounding/FZ/DN combinations with clear and set exception flags. All96 calls preserve public RAM and FPSCR. This admits constant substitution for these arguments only."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "5127 pairs comprise2758 direct,2047 core-integrated and322 frame-integrated cases. Direct cases include21 matching selected faults. The direct/core fixtures execute all522 new native instruction bytes; frame cases exercise288 decoder bytes reachable in the R1 fixed chip1/type0 path, plus all380 frame/report bytes and74 round-helper bytes. Its core coverage is576 bytes; the separate core fixture covers all682.",
    "All numeric helpers are real C/native bodies, with no math mocks. Frame integration also executes real clear helpers. Thirteen later processing stages and allocator/free ports remain modeled. This is not a complete SpO2 engine, inference executor, actual allocator lifecycle or bootable image.",
    "Independent Fraction oracles cover float32 and float64 rounding, operation order and full active FPSCR. Tests cover signed samples, unsigned drives through65535, boundary and randomly sampled byte bit-count/gain values, nominal/reserved gain reads, aliased output/header/gain state, group sign/wrap and unspecified data types. Physical interrupts, concurrent data changes, arbitrary private aliases and cold FPU remain unverified.",
    "The120-byte initializer matches the native RW handler on two poison patterns and an independent decompressor, with whole-region guards. Only these30 words are newly owned; the adjacent callback table is not calibration and is neither declared nor initialized by this source owner. Reserved physical-SRAM reads and final source initialization/placement remain hardware-layout obligations.",
    "903 units compile/compose without failures or duplicate strong symbols.892 prior nongenerated source/object pairs and source-plan/cache files remain unchanged. Decoder import removed with no added imports:90 application/22 boot. Relocatable composition is not a bootable image."
  ],
